  "term": "pigment regeneration",
  "definition": "Pigment regeneration is the renewal of visual pigment in the retina. In this source, it is described as a retinal process influenced by the composition of the interphotoreceptor matrix and related exchanges between photoreceptors and the retinal pigment epithelium.",
